# Linux Day 1 Practice 

Today I learned basic Linux commands in Ubuntu terminal.
 Commands Practiced
 1. pwd
Used to display the current working directory.
 2. ls
Used to list files and folders in the current directory.
 3. mkdir
Used to create a new directory/folder.
 4. cd
Used to navigate between directories.
 5. touch
Used to create a new empty file.
 Outcome
Practiced basic navigation and file handling commands in Linux terminal using Ubuntu.
